	(text_box "Expansion card for the pcs_bldc H7 main board, mini PCIe form factor.\nCUSTOM pinout - this is not a PCIe card and must not go into a PC slot:\n  EXP_5V0 (switched, about 1 A) on pins 2 / 24 / 39 / 41 / 52\n  3V3_ID on pin 6: feeds only the card ID EEPROM\n  QSPI (EtherCAT host link) on the PCIe lane pins; 33R series resistors are on the main board\nThe card edge is 1.0 mm PCB. The two standoff holes are part of the card-edge footprint.\nJ1 / J2 are wider than a standard 30 mm card: the outline follows the main board (38.1 mm)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220.98 60.96 0)
		(size 111.76 20.32)
